,"shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TZtHwdlpzLebhzjGuagR4A","review_id":"dq2r1cx82vwLiGEvVFWKVA","date":"2019-07-13T20:04:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9052473306655884,"text_excerpt":"Right around the block. This place somehow always manages to have the things I need. One morning my hungover girlfriend requested: (1) purple pedialyte, (2) yellow Gatorade, (3) a mini ginger ale, (4) D Battery's (????)and (5) two small bags of lays potato chips. It was all there. I was amazed. How much of my amazement should be contributed to the fact that I was baked out of my mind? Idk. Also, the people that own the place are the nicest. There's a good sense of community, the owners are great, and they have a magic genie lamp that produces everything your hungover girlfriend NEEDS. Top notch."},{"business_id":"TZtHwdlpzLebhzjGuagR4A","review_id":"iZYjRYWrqRGi7THQa3lGEw","date":"2012-06-24T07:16:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8979065418243408,"text_excerpt":"I always said that Parkway had the best shrimp po boys in the city, however Olympia is a STRONG tie for that first place. If you know anything about parkway's shrimp po boys, then you know it's the business. Olympia however offers just as good (if not better) shrimp as parkway, and the prices are clutch. I can get a large shrimp po boy combo with fries and a drink for less than one po boy alone at most other places. I've had other sandwiches and hot lunches and have never been disappointed, great neighborhood store."},{"business_id":"TZtHwdlpzLebhzjGuagR4A","review_id":"he43V2aPxfQusEEeIF3ehg","date":"2020-11-14T18:02:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8823949694633484,"text_excerpt":"Great fried shrimp po-boy. Great staff and plenty of off street parking. Highly recommended."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
